Article 25 (Delegation of authority) The Minister of Trade, Industry and Resources shall delegate his or her authority in the following to the Administrator of the Korean Agency for Technology and Standards pursuant to Article 24 of the Act: <Amended on Mar. 23, 2013; Dec. 11, 2013; Jul. 24, 2015; Nov. 18, 2015; Jun. 9, 2020; Oct. 1, 2025; Jun. 2, 2026>
