  4. Issuing an order for recall, etc. and publication under Article 11(1) of the Act;
  4-2. Receiving reports on the results, etc. of the measures taken under Article 11(2) of the Act;
  5. Taking measures such as product recall, etc. and collecting expenses under Article 11(3) of the Act;
  6. Full or partial withdrawing of a recommendation or order for recall, etc. under Article 12(2) of the Act;
  6-2. Receiving reports on defects of products under Article 13(1) of the Act;
  6-3. Receiving reports on the outcomes of product recall, etc. under Article 13(2) of the Act;
  6-4. Receiving reports on measures such as product recall, etc. in foreign countries and reports on measures such as product recall, etc. taken by other business entities in a foreign country under Article 13(3) of the Act;
  6-5. Receiving reports on serious accidents under Article 13-2(1) of the Act;
  6-6. Issuing an accident investigation order and receiving reports on accident investigation results under Article 13-3(1) and (3) of the Act;
  7. Requests for data to investigate product accidents under Article 15(1) of the Act;
